UHHRL0LBcQ3YcHCGQoAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwizh5Xr99SWAxWCUPUHHRL0LBcQ3IcHCGMoBQ",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["湯頭很好 不管是有肉還是湯麵\n裡面都會有兩大塊蘿蔔\n第一次去蘿蔔煮比較軟\n第二次去有比較硬一點，但還是好吃\n\n個人喜歡牛肉、牛肚麵\n肉的份量充足\n牛肉很軟\n\n羊肉麵個人覺得肉比較乾\n但同行友人很喜歡\n\n湯頭清爽好喝，每次湯都喝完\n麵條算是細的拉麵，個人蠻喜歡的\n\n羊辣油比牛辣油辣一點\n花干好吃\n海帶滷的很軟\n滷蛋就正常發揮\n滷大腸缺貨，沒吃到飲恨\n可惜沒有燙青菜\n\n騎機車去比較方便\n除了他們門口有少數位子\n橋下停機車用悠遊卡一通卡入場15元，便宜便利\n\n開車的話要看運氣\n附近停車位很常滿\n（後面近全聯那個地下室更是像在考駕照）\n橋下又居多是月租的\n\n內用冷氣超級涼\n某些位子甚至是會到冷的程度\n很讚\n\n整體來說是算非常完美的店家\n會常常回訪",null,[0,36]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6147926054488957811/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhCZEZFeVZrcFRSMjkwVmxob1psWlljRk5hUjJoSllXcGtkV1J0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6147926054488957811/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhCZEZFeVZrcFRSMjkwVmxob1psWlljRk5hUjJoSllXcGtkV1J0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6147926054488957811/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhCZEZFeVZrcFRSMjkwVmxob1psWlljRk5hUjJoSllXcGtkV1J0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6147926054488957811/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhCZEZFeVZrcFRSMjkwVmxob1psWlljRk5hUjJoSllXcGtkV1J0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6147926054488957811/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhCZEZFeVZrcFRSMjkwVmxob1psWlljRk5hUjJoSllXcGtkV1J0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6147926054488957811/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhCZEZFeVZrcFRSMjkwVmxob1psWlljRk5hUjJoSllXcGtkV1J0WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,7847,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xBdFEyVkpTR290VlhoZlZYcFNaR2hJYWpkdWRtYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x71b6659089655a9b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlAtQ2VJSGotVXhfVXpSZGhIajdudmc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["ht